tile:0:5:112:120:260:260:bridge
zone:0:5:112:120:260:260:Anne Frank's Chestnut Tree (Amsterdam, Netherlands) This tree provided solace to Anne Frank during her family's hiding in World War II.  After its death in 2010, saplings from its chestnuts were planted globally
