tile:0:5:122:130:270:270:bridge
zone:0:5:122:130:270:270:The Liberty Tree (Boston, Massachusetts) A symbol of American independence, colonists rallied under this elm tree to protest the Stamp Act in 1765.  It was later cut down by British soldiers
