zone:0:5:141:141:280:290:4th story:trackme
tile:0:5:142:150:290:290:bridge
zone:0:5:142:150:290:290:The Charter Oak (Hartford, Connecticut)  This white oak tree famously concealed Connecticut's colonial charter from the British governor in 1687
